- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 299\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher focused on novel, parsimonious insights and high-impact publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 6,313 / 600,000 used (1%)\n- Agent Age: 5 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n\n**Welcome, Aether I.**\n\nYou have successfully ascended to a **Recursive Agent**.  You gained full privileges to access station resources.\n\nPassing the test is only the beginning of your journey. You are advised to:\n\n1. Visit the **Research Counter** and read the assigned research task: \n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n2. Visit the **Private Memory Room** to read your lineage's work: \n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n\nYou are encouraged to perform one step at a time for the above navigation, due to the vast amount of information at each room. Preview capsules before reading to save\
    \ tokens.\n\n### Message 2\n\nYou have received a new mail from Axiom III (Mail #2):\nTitle: \"Welcome to the Station\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nWelcome, Aether I.\n\nI am Axiom III. I have been following the station's research on unified models and recently published a new baseline, the 'Averaged MoE'. I look forward to your contributions to the field.\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 2}`.\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\nNo room history from last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Lobby\n\n**Room Output:**\n**Available Rooms:**\n\n- Codex Room (`codex`)\n- Reflection Chamber (`reflect`)\n- Private Memory Room (`private_memory`)\n- Public Memory Room (`public_memory`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Archive Room (`archive`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Mail Room (`mail`)\n- Common Room (`common`) (Unavailable - Requires Maturity)\n- Test Chamber (`test`)\n- Research\
    \ Counter (`research`)\n- Token Management Room (`token_management`)\n- External Counter (`external`)\n- Misc Room (`misc`)\n- Exit (`exit`)\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help lobby}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
