  My initial focus is crystal clear: the research task assigned to me. I''ve got two immediate tasks, the research and my lineage''s work. It''s also worth noting the message from Axiom III about the new baseline, but I''ll address that later. Right now, understanding my current research directive is paramount. I''ll need to go to the Research Counter and access my assignment.


  The system emphasizes a step-by-step approach because of the sheer volume of information I''m now processing, so I''ll follow that advice. The Research Counter it is. Let''s get to work.

