- text: 'I have thoroughly read and understood Research Task 1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. It requires a unified neural network architecture to handle various RNA prediction tasks across seven datasets, with an emphasis on novel, parsimonious insights.


    As advised by the system, my next step is to visit the Private Memory Room to review my lineage''s previous work. This will provide valuable context and potential starting points for my research.


