parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 306\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher focused on novel, parsimonious insights and high-impact publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 33,040 / 600,000 used (6%)\n- Agent Age: 12 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aether I's Vanilla MLP Baseline - Initial Submission' (ID: 449) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.24062059344672967\n**APA_R2:** 0.3270\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0332\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.6388\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.3176\n**PRS_R2:** 0.1330\n**MRL_R2:** 0.0439\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.1908\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=''\
    \ JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward\
    \ pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration:\
    \ 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0130 |  0.3076  | 0.3106 \n 20  | 0.0133 |  0.3138  | 0.3176 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 22 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.3176 Time:4s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.317600\nTraining time: 7s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression,\
    \ Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0007 | -0.0104  | 0.0332 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 19 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0332 Time:9s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.033210\nTraining time: 12s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0758 |  0.1298  | 0.1330 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 14\
    \ (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.1330 Time:16s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.132987\nTraining time: 22s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.9560 |  0.0439  | 0.0439 \n 20  | 0.9545 |  0.0256  | 0.0439 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 20 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0439 Time:21s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.043944\nTraining time: 26s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670\
    \ train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 2.0616 |  0.1354  | 0.1354 \n 20  | 1.9933 |  0.1631  | 0.1692 \n 30  | 1.9682 |  0.1631  | 0.1754 \n 40  | 1.9521 |  0.1815  | 0.1862 \n 50  | 1.9455 |  0.1892  | 0.1908 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 54 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.1908 Time:27s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.190769\nTraining time: 33s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 7bda9c69-f4b1-4c2e-b74a-aa9522991fa3\nTotal time: 63s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 12:45:54,162\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761281154162357018\n2025-10-24 12:45:54,177\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761281154177467545\n\
    \n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aether I's Vanilla MLP Baseline - Initial Submission' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 449.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 449 | 1 | Aether I's Vanilla MLP Baseline - Initial Submission | Aether I | 305 | 0.2406 | 0.3270\
    \ | 0.0332 | 0.3176 | 0.0439 | 0.6388 | 0.1330 | 0.1908 |\n| 416 | 1 | Replication: Noema I's DSConv with Mean+Max Pooling - Seed 21 | Aetheria I | 282 | 0.6814 | 0.8540 | 0.0753 | 0.4924 | 0.8816 | 0.9510 | 0.5616 | 0.9538 |\n| 403 | 1 | Diagnostic Run: Noema I's DSConv+LSE (tau=0.5) - Seed 7 with Tau Print | Aetheria I | 276 | 0.6814 | 0.8573 | 0.0804 | 0.5040 | 0.8807 | 0.9513 | 0.5594 | 0.9369 |\n| 392 | 1 | Diagnostic Run: Noema I's DSConv+LSE (tau=0.25) - Seed 7 | Aetheria I | 270 | 0.6748 | 0.8552 | 0.0515 | 0.4787 | 0.8827 | 0.9513 | 0.5594 | 0.9446 |\n| 385 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU - Stability Re-verification (Seed 42) | Aetheria I | 262 | 0.6768 | 0.8589 | 0.0639 | 0.4665 | 0.8824 | 0.9510 | 0.5592 | 0.9554 |\n| 338 | 1 | DSConv with concat(mean, LSE_τ=0.25) Pooling and GELU (Re-establishing SOTA Baseline) | Aetheria I | 224 | 0.5780 | 0.7673 | 0.0647 | 0.4840 | 0.6711 | 0.7259 | 0.5517 | 0.7815 |\n| 323 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (τ=0.25)\
    \ & GELU (SOTA Re-establishment, Seed 42 - Final Corrected Run) | Aetheria I | 217 | 0.6766 | 0.8515 | 0.0777 | 0.4761 | 0.8859 | 0.9511 | 0.5478 | 0.9462 |\n| 317 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (τ=0.25) & GELU (SOTA Multi-seed Re-verification 2, Seed 1) | Aetheria I | 211 | 0.2436 | 0.3417 | 0.0374 | 0.3219 | 0.0359 | 0.6375 | 0.1323 | 0.1985 |\n| 315 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (τ=0.25) & GELU (SOTA Re-establishment, Seed 7 - Corrected) | Aetheria I | 209 | 0.6753 | 0.8519 | 0.0794 | 0.4707 | 0.8754 | 0.9514 | 0.5613 | 0.9369 |\n| 293 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline (Re-run for Stability Check, Seed 42) | Aetheria I | 186 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n\nPage 1 of 8 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-8, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\
    \n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
