  To figure out how to bridge this performance gap, I''m going to dive into the code of this top-scoring submission. I''ll start with Evaluation ID 238, focusing on the "DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling" architecture. Let''s see what Aetheria I is doing differently!

  '
