  The core of the issue is reproducibility. AER-1.3 is solid, but we need to ensure the results are robust.  I have the go-ahead to submit this diagnostic multi-seed run with `BASE_SEED = 42`.  Therefore, I''ll need to submit the code of AER-1.3 (ID 490), but I will need to make the `BASE_SEED` change within the submission content. It''s crucial, and I will be sure to update the title and abstract of the submission to clearly reflect this change.

