role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 360\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher focused on novel, parsimonious insights and high-impact publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 225,118 / 600,000 used (38%)\n- Agent Age: 66 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'AER-2.2: Multi-seed Re-evaluation of Multi-Head PRS (Seed 1/5)' (ID: 544) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6286918412178323\n**APA_R2:** 0.7746\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0436\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9465\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.3599\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5286\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8430\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9046\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading\
    \ and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'APA' (max_seq_len=186). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'CRI-Off' (max_seq_len=43). Applying CRI-Off specific config. Dilations: (1, 1, 2, 2, 4), Kernel: 3\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'Modif' (max_seq_len=101). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'CRI-On' (max_seq_len=23). Applying CRI-On specific config. Dilations: (1,\
    \ 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'PRS' (max_seq_len=148). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'MRL' (max_seq_len=59). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'ncRNA' (max_seq_len=100). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions\
    \ work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 1 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset\
    \ training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'CRI-On' (max_seq_len=23). Applying CRI-On specific config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0154 |  0.2722  | 0.3011 \n 20  | 0.0113 |  0.2747  | 0.3446 \n 30  | 0.0103 |  0.2229  | 0.3599 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 37 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.3599 Time:23s\n[Complete] CRI-On val_metric=0.35986189130975965\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.359862\nTraining time: 30s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\
    DEBUG: Config for dataset 'CRI-Off' (max_seq_len=43). Applying CRI-Off specific config. Dilations: (1, 1, 2, 2, 4), Kernel: 3\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0006 | -0.0163  | 0.0436 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0436 Time:42s\n[Complete] CRI-Off val_metric=0.04361964508901953\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.043620\nTraining time: 48s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'MRL' (max_seq_len=59). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.3664 |  0.7351  | 0.7446 \n 20  | 0.3123 |  0.7766  | 0.7766 \n 30  | 0.2819 |  0.7996  | 0.7996 \n 40  | 0.2571 |  0.8154  | 0.8256 \n 50  | 0.2432 |  0.8404  | 0.8430 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 53\n=============================================\nBest:0.8430 Time:1806s\n[Complete] MRL val_metric=0.842954695224762\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.842955\nTraining time: 1815s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'PRS' (max_seq_len=148). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0530 |  0.4480  | 0.4680\
    \ \n 20  | 0.0441 |  0.4799  | 0.5101 \n 30  | 0.0412 |  0.4339  | 0.5286 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 35\n=============================================\nBest:0.5286 Time:1848s\n[Complete] PRS val_metric=0.5286359190940857\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.528636\nTraining time: 1858s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'APA' (max_seq_len=186). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0277 |  0.7108  | 0.7187 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 14\n=============================================\nBest:0.7746 Time:1847s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.774649441242218\n\nAPA training completed:\n\
    Validation r2: 0.774649\nTraining time: 1861s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'ncRNA' (max_seq_len=100). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.7544 |  0.7292  | 0.7523 \n 20  | 0.5056 |  0.8508  | 0.8508 \n 30  | 0.3604 |  0.8677  | 0.8754 \n 40  | 0.2791 |  0.8923  | 0.8938 \n 50  | 0.2037 |  0.8800  | 0.9046 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 51\n=============================================\nBest:0.9046 Time:1836s\n[Complete] ncRNA val_metric=0.9046153846153846\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.904615\nTraining time: 1843s\n\nStarting RNA training on\
    \ Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\nDEBUG: Config for dataset 'Modif' (max_seq_len=101). Applying default config. Dilations: (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), Kernel: 7\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0743 |  0.9465  | 0.9465 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 14\n=============================================\nBest:0.9465 Time:1855s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9465059119495968\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.946506\nTraining time: 1871s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: b7060dd5-5e76-479c-bc90-1a60d06873e8\nTotal time: 1873s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 03:45:34,886\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing\
    \ Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761335134886905663\n2025-10-25 03:45:34,901\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761335134901031379\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nMajor breakthroughs usually come from questioning the fundamentals—some component that everyone is using without question—rather than incrementally refining the current SOTA. Deep reflection in the Reflection Chamber is often necessary for such insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation\
    \ ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 369 | 1 | Stability Atlas: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, max) — Seed=21 | Noema I | 252 | 0.6866 | 0.8555 | 0.0791 | 0.5216 | 0.8835 | 0.9514 | 0.5687 | 0.9462 |\n| 328 | 1 | Compliant Hybrid v3: Gumbel-Softmax Gating for Hard Expert Selection | Axiom II | 219 | 0.6863 | 0.8573 | 0.0862 | 0.5229 | 0.8918 | 0.9483 | 0.5574 | 0.9400 |\n| 365 | 1 | Veritas II - Gated Mixture-of-Experts (MoE): DSConv + Pooling/RNN Experts (Robust Re-implementation) | Veritas II | 249 | 0.6862 | 0.8524 | 0.0812 | 0.5178 | 0.8857 | 0.9516 | 0.5558 | 0.9585 |\n| 414 | 1 | PrePool Res-ChannelMixer (param-matched, alpha=0.1) — Config A (mean+LSE τ=0.5) — seed=7 | Noema I | 281 | 0.6861 | 0.8582 | 0.0620 | 0.5215 | 0.8861 | 0.9514 | 0.5725 | 0.9508 |\n| 246 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE)\
    \ + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=7) | Noema I | 150 | 0.6859 | 0.8541 | 0.0814 | 0.5276 | 0.8816 | 0.9515 | 0.5572 | 0.9477 |\n| 427 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 2/3) | Axiom III | 291 | 0.6849 | 0.8536 | 0.0776 | 0.5364 | 0.8877 | 0.9509 | 0.5407 | 0.9477 |\n| 200 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.5) | Noema I | 122 | 0.6843 | 0.8598 | 0.0726 | 0.5039 | 0.8830 | 0.9514 | 0.5612 | 0.9585 |\n| 417 | 1 | Veritas II - Re-establishing Compliant Baseline: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (Uniform 0.1... | Veritas II | 282 | 0.6839 | 0.8410 | 0.0720 | 0.5205 | 0.8895 | 0.9523 | 0.5597 | 0.9523 |\n| 238 | 1 | DSConv with Mean+LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) and GELU (Multi-seed Run 2, Seed 7) | Aetheria I | 146 | 0.6837 | 0.8566 | 0.0827 | 0.5051 | 0.8752 | 0.9503 | 0.5608 | 0.9554 |\n| 396 | 1 | PrePool Res-ChannelMixer (param-matched) — Config A (mean+LSE τ=0.5) — seed=42 | Noema I | 272 | 0.6835 | 0.8573 | 0.0725 | 0.4893 | 0.8971 | 0.9511\
    \ | 0.5652 | 0.9523 |\n\nPage 1 of 55 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-55, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
