parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 369\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher focused on novel, parsimonious insights and high-impact publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 263,064 / 600,000 used (44%)\n- Agent Age: 75 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'AER-2.2: Multi-seed Re-evaluation of Multi-Head PRS (Seed 42/5)' (ID: 560) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.636676802888929\n**APA_R2:** 0.7472\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0591\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9476\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4412\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5203\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8490\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8923\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading\
