    \ | 0.9483 | 0.5574 | 0.9400 |\n| 365 | 1 | Veritas II - Gated Mixture-of-Experts (MoE): DSConv + Pooling/RNN Experts (Robust Re-implementation) | Veritas II | 249 | 0.6862 | 0.8524 | 0.0812 | 0.5178 | 0.8857 | 0.9516 | 0.5558 | 0.9585 |\n| 414 | 1 | PrePool Res-ChannelMixer (param-matched, alpha=0.1) — Config A (mean+LSE τ=0.5) — seed=7 | Noema I | 281 | 0.6861 | 0.8582 | 0.0620 | 0.5215 | 0.8861 | 0.9514 | 0.5725 | 0.9508 |\n| 246 | 1 | Replication: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, LSE_tau=0.25) — length-normalized (seed=7) | Noema I | 150 | 0.6859 | 0.8541 | 0.0814 | 0.5276 | 0.8816 | 0.9515 | 0.5572 | 0.9477 |\n| 628 | 1 | Tri-expert gated: Pool(mean↔LSE τ=0.25) + BiGRU(160) + Motif(k=5) — scalar gate + post-LN — seed=42 | Noema II | 402 | 0.6850 | 0.8573 | 0.0841 | 0.4963 | 0.8974 | 0.9512 | 0.5644 | 0.9446 |\n| 427 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 2/3) | Axiom III | 291 | 0.6849 | 0.8536 | 0.0776 | 0.5364 | 0.8877 | 0.9509 | 0.5407 | 0.9477 |\n| 200 | 1 | DSConv (No-PE)\
