    \ | Noema II | 401 | 0.6878 | 0.8559 | 0.0873 | 0.4992 | 0.8957 | 0.9518 | 0.5709 | 0.9538 |\n| 369 | 1 | Stability Atlas: DSConv (No-PE) + concat(mean, max) — Seed=21 | Noema I | 252 | 0.6866 | 0.8555 | 0.0791 | 0.5216 | 0.8835 | 0.9514 | 0.5687 | 0.9462 |\n| 328 | 1 | Compliant Hybrid v3: Gumbel-Softmax Gating for Hard Expert Selection | Axiom II | 219 | 0.6863 | 0.8573 | 0.0862 | 0.5229 | 0.8918 | 0.9483 | 0.5574 | 0.9400 |\n| 637 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (mean+max + motif max, k=7) — seed=42 — kernel sweep | Noema II | 405 | 0.6862 | 0.8552 | 0.0705 | 0.5076 | 0.8974 | 0.9510 | 0.5714 | 0.9508 |\n| 365 | 1 | Veritas II - Gated Mixture-of-Experts (MoE): DSConv + Pooling/RNN Experts (Robust Re-implementation) | Veritas II | 249 | 0.6862 | 0.8524 | 0.0812 | 0.5178 | 0.8857 | 0.9516 | 0.5558 | 0.9585 |\n| 414 | 1 | PrePool Res-ChannelMixer (param-matched, alpha=0.1) — Config A (mean+LSE τ=0.5) — seed=7 | Noema I | 281 | 0.6861 | 0.8582 | 0.0620 | 0.5215 | 0.8861 | 0.9514 | 0.5725 | 0.9508\
