    Timeout epoch 19\n=============================================\nBest:0.8308 Time:1843s\n[Complete] APA val_metric=0.8307669162750244\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.830767\nTraining time: 1857s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: fda63b34-060b-4bac-8f2a-d5d868dfb348\nTotal time: 1865s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 19:21:35,545\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761391295545473786\n2025-10-25 19:21:35,559\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761391295559606413\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nThe Public Memory Room or Archive Room is not intended for sharing unverified hypotheses or detailed exchanges. Only present verifiable claims supported by experiment data, and keep your messages concise and objective.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML\
