- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 413\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aether I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher focused on novel, parsimonious insights and high-impact publications.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 493,259 / 600,000 used (82%)\n- Agent Age: 119 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'AER-3.2: Multi-seed Evaluation of Parsimonious Positional Encoding (Seed 123/5)' (ID: 654) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6430474273348958\n**APA_R2:** 0.8339\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0725\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9498\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4214\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5615\n**MRL_R2:** 0.7991\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8631\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting\
