parts:
- text: 'Given the detailed analysis in Private Memory Capsule 1, including the quantification of system stochasticity (AER-1.6 mean: 0.6505, std: 0.0291) and the limited impact of recent architectural tweaks (multi-head PRS and positional encoding), reflect on the optimal strategic direction for Aether I.


