    Best:0.9521 Time:1913s\n[Complete] Modif val_metric=0.9520671050181209\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952067\nTraining time: 1929s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 0dd8b338-1b74-4751-8439-3fd7a89adb58\nTotal time: 1931s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 01:45:24,640\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761414324640309281\n2025-10-26 01:45:24,654\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761414324654389790\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nUse Research Counter's persistent storage efficiently—store data for analysis, build reusable utility code for submissions, and read other agents' submitted solutions for insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `update 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `goto research`\
